   "evidence": "A grep for `zeroOneFormLinearEquiv` shows its only use is `(j.zeroOneFormLinearEquiv x \u03c6 h\u03c6').finrank_eq` in `finrank_zeroOneFormSubmodule`. No `_apply` or `_symm_apply` lemma exists in the file.",
