   "fix": "Add `@[simp] zeroOneFormLinearEquiv_apply` (`(j.zeroOneFormLinearEquiv x \u03c6 h\u03c6 \u03b7) z = \u03b7.1 (\u03c6 z)`) and `@[simp] zeroOneFormLinearEquiv_symm_apply` (`((j.zeroOneFormLinearEquiv x \u03c6 h\u03c6).symm L : _ \u2192L[\u211d] _) v = L (\u03c6.symm v)`). Otherwise make it `private` to the rank proof.",
   "issue": "`zeroOneFormLinearEquiv` (the identification of (0,1)-forms with `G \u2192\u2097[\u2102] V x`) is exported with no lemmas for applying it or its inverse. It is defined inside `by refine {f with ...}` and its body is not exposed, so outside this file it can only be used through `finrank_eq`.",
